{"version":1,"key":"article:47","content":{"id":47,"title":"TypeScript之类型守卫","author":"","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"127cb5fc-aa53-4ee6-a97a-369c264de37a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一个值可能同时具有多种可能的类型，在断言为具体的类型之前只能使用公共的属性和方法"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"54136a83-412a-4cc6-837c-d75d0a9b0354","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"248782f0-8e7b-4bbd-af40-70a0c95b5c93","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const strOrNum: string | number = \"a\";\n// ❎\nstrOrNum.toLowerCase();\n// ✅\n(strOrNum as string).toLowerCase();","collabId":"f7c0cfca-5bc2-4bd1-9b83-5bfc9dfa34d9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"739b163a-8145-41fa-ab23-ee3869997922","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"as"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 断言为主动断言，还可以通过一些方法判断类型，ts 可以帮助将类型进行收缩"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"6a4df4b4-cea2-48c0-a8ce-c80a5037e0cd","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"e6c5812a-1354-4d9c-8761-5e7decebaf72","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const strOrNum: string | number = \"a\";\nif (typeof strOrNum === 'string') {\n  // 经过 typeof 判断后，类型收缩到 string 类型\n  // 不用手动断言即可直接使用 string 下的方法\n  strOrNum.toLowerCase();\n} else {\n  // 此处会将 string 这种可能性去掉，因此只能是 number\n  // 可以使用 number 独有的方法\n  strOrNum.toFixed(2);\n}","collabId":"6c649cc1-d142-49a5-b60b-32fe0032471d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1dda14a4-da70-4359-9d22-a07ef8e967ca","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"根据分支的判断条件，ts 会尝试推导类型，将值可能的类型进行尽可能的收窄，这种类型推断的行为称之为"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"类型守卫"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"typeof"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是一种常见的类型守卫，除此之外，还有其它的类型守卫，如："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"1e7ba311-5651-4dba-98fd-43ef13c8650d","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"b4b3d14d-c0e0-49b8-9dec-49629f2dfb29","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b8a8b550-7d7f-4ce3-8b29-0da7102017dc","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"==="}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"6263b46b-29eb-42ea-a5e1-1283329553dd","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c6f0232b-97a2-49e7-be72-2bdae84a2f36","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"in"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"47ae1ac6-b52e-4e5f-8377-97ff49ce0563","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"245c773e-03b2-4e8e-88dc-39b977cf0743","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"instanceof"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"c8fcac78-b813-4776-8115-4555d073460e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"203794ad-3553-4235-857e-c107e689989c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"类型守卫函数"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"d6448ca9-6688-4043-b538-04da2e001005","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"598b38fc-b472-4ca5-b78c-b27cd6022364","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"断言函数"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9ba2fed4-2720-40a5-a286-8085cea62904","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"==="},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"!=="},{"type":"formatted","text":" 一般用于字面量类型的判断"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"89f2be9d-693f-45ed-973f-d2857df9190d","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"1f561186-8341-4f82-b0aa-e844c233e36a","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const oneOr1: \"one\" | 1 = 1;\n\nif (oneOr1 === 1) {\n  // 是数字 1\n} else {\n  // 是英文 one\n}","collabId":"832eda4a-d210-4e49-bf5a-430b2b498a06","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3c68e461-3c02-44ca-bcdf-9b6203cc1027","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"也可用于对象属性的字面量判断，从而区分类型"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"436726ab-0449-40d5-b908-e68ea633f4de","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"db840b29-139b-4b5e-ab77-879133b7c8fe","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"enum EType {\n\tDOG = 1,\n  CAT = 2\n}\n\ninterface Dog {\n  type: EType.DOG;\n  name: string;\n}\n\ninterface Cat {\n  type: EType.CAT;\n  name: string;\n}\n\nconst dogOrCat = {\n  type: EType.DOG,\n  name: '旺财'\n}\n\nif (dogOrCat.type === EType.DOG) {\n  // 是 Dog 类型\n} else {\n  // 是 Cat 类型\n}","collabId":"99cf4ced-49ab-46c2-9f3a-ce415b61f0f4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"note","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"b8a876ff-80c5-46ac-b716-93a33c338db4","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1b4cb94e-1364-45d2-928d-2e723652255a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"==="},{"type":"formatted","text":" 判断对象的属性来收缩对象类型时，要确保该属性是"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"highlight":true,"text":"字面量类型"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，比如我将 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Dog"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Cat"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的类型都声明为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"EType"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就无法进行类型推断"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"5e121f6f-37ae-456b-aaae-4d02db5fcd46","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"d5f29755-185b-4606-9a8b-382abbd46141","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"interface Dog {\n  type: EType;\n  name: string;\n}\n\ninterface Cat {\n  type: EType;\n  name: string;\n}","collabId":"d3cf389f-e602-4721-ad8b-8cab087d1b15","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"75e35f4c-c5a6-4d8d-880e-11f43905db5f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这种情况下可以使用"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"自定义类型守卫"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，见下。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1f6de503-4787-4934-a9d9-0f25ad9bec66","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"in"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 操作符可以判断某个属性是否存在于对象中，如果某个对象具有独一无二的属性，通过此判断可以将类型收缩到此对象类型"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"39dec1a9-1e17-42d3-9824-05f1f9680323","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"3a26bf31-6628-44f7-bc7d-465f60d5b0a1","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"interface Foo {\n  fooOnly: boolean;\n  shared: number;\n}\n\ninterface Bar {\n  barOnly: boolean;\n  shared: number;\n}\n\ndeclare const i: Foo | Bar;\nif ('barOnly' in i) {\n  // 收缩为 Bar 类型\n} else {\n  // 收缩为 Foo 类型\n}","collabId":"d52026d1-066d-4180-9ca9-6255cf99ce0a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2146b368-ccc9-4f55-9ce8-ba52bb12af4c","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"instanceof"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是用来判断值是否是某个类的示例"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"0f33cc47-027c-4b8b-aa41-ca8901abc921","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"e1c14061-9b8e-445f-913a-0493a6c4cc22","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"class Foo {\n\tfoo();\n}\n\nclass Bar {\n\tbar();\n}\n\ndeclare const input: Foo | Bar;\n\nif (input instanceof Foo) {\n  // 收缩为 Foo 的实例，可以调用 foo 方法\n  input.foo();\n} else {\n  // 收缩为 Bar 的实例\n  input.bar();\n}","collabId":"8be5f101-21b5-446f-a16f-cb690ad28c76","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9c3887a3-f17d-498b-bdd1-2dabf6f2651b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"考虑如下两个类型"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"31473eae-abbb-4b45-8c79-2ef7f52824ee","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"121e4294-42bd-4cde-97cc-40e69e205d71","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"interface Foo {\n  type: string;\n}\n\ninterface Bar {\n  type: number;\n}","collabId":"15955048-9691-44f7-8eaa-6eec9f8a8599","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1530209b-8202-4f10-8d9a-5c48ad96bb3f","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Foo"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Bar"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 都包含有 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"type"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类型，并且是不同的类型，但是我们却不能通过判断 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"type"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的类型使得类型进行收缩"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"0648995d-8794-45ed-9964-651af4529eb5","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"9180b29d-d920-452c-aecd-000fe5a50381","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"declare const a: Foo | Bar;\nif (typeof a.type === 'string') {\n  // 不能将 a 收缩到 Foo 类型\n}","collabId":"1c4aa4e1-aca4-4899-8320-66a83b8dcf0c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"69bf535b-1aac-403a-81c4-0a331140edae","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这个时候可以使用自定义的类型守卫"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"71ea6a45-175e-4126-9ec7-0c9163da0506","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"af5a91ea-4142-4f3a-8259-5d90f0ceb7e0","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"function isFoo(val: Foo | Bar) val is Foo  {\n  return typeof val.type === 'string';\n}\n\nif (isFoo(a)) {\n  // 可以收缩到 Foo 类型\n}","collabId":"b5b8ed39-94c9-4077-a2da-4c3490a15436","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e8322cee-0194-4dd0-9520-01bc71ad64d7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"标准库的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Array.isArray"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法就是通过这种方式将类型收缩到数组的："}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022/raw/master/image.73el2m1zoh40.png","previewUrl":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022/raw/master/image.73el2m1zoh40.png","width":457.8047538104265,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"69ab6bdf-4d79-4382-a5a0-5d50a67f2a71","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"66653471-62bb-4c56-89e2-82e665106c3a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"还有一种方法可以收缩类型，那就是断言，断言一般常见于测试中，一旦断言失败，就表示未达到预期，抛出异常，退出程序。因此能运行到断言后面的代码，就表示断言通过了，可以通过这一特性来收缩类型"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"96f5675a-eba4-4c90-a524-8fb0939c1ba1","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"bc13b933-66bd-4434-aca4-1da0303da090","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"function assertIsNumber(val: any): assert val is number {\n  if (!typeof val !== 'number') {\n    throw new Error();\n  }\n}\n\nconst val: number | string = 12;\nassertIsNumber(val);\n\n// 运行到这里，说明上面的断言通过了，此时 val 的类型一定是 number\nval * 100;","collabId":"227ab248-de2a-4f3f-b462-8960fa816513","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["TypeScript"],"bannerBg":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/C__Users_pc_.editor_resources_michiel-annaert-nE9eUMw8SV0-unsplash_a5de4560-b9aa-4422-9ed2-354c8ed4f462_55d1d58d-63b6-4ab6-960f-6cbf2883362f.jpg","createTime":1720063275870,"updateTime":1777725278914},"meta":{"type":"article","publishTime":1777725278914}}